    "title": "C Major, Three Ways, on the Top Three Strings",
    "summary": "The three C major grips on strings 1-2-3, met in neck order, and the diagram that shows they're one climbing cycle rather than three shapes to memorise.",
    "tags": ["triads", "chords", "fretboard"],
    "readingTimeMin": 3,
